Value PROTOCOL (\S+)
Value NETWORK (\S+)
Value NEXT_HOP (\S+)
Value METRIC (\S+)
Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value UPTIME (\S+)

Start
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+is directly connected,\s+${INTERFACE} -> Record
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+\[${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXT_HOP},\s+${UPTIME},\s+${INTERFACE} -> Record
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+\[${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXT_HOP},\s+${INTERFACE} -> Record
  ^${PROTOCOL}\s+${NETWORK}\s+\[${METRIC}\]\s+via\s+${NEXT_HOP} -> Record
  ^.* -> Next
